OL,3,GNEWSAKittens with deformed tails found
OL,4,Aabandoned
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive kittens, four of whom have
OL,7,Fdeformed or no tails, are receiving
OL,8,Faround-the-clock care after being found
OL,9,Fabandoned.
OL,11,FPatricia, Patrick, Pamela, Pauline, and
OL,12,FPetunia arrived at The Cotswolds Dogs &
OL,13,FCats Home in Gloucestershire about two
OL,14,Fweeks ago after a member of the public
OL,15,Ffound them.
OL,17,FThey were thought to be five weeks old
OL,18,Fwhen they arrived, staff said they were
OL,19,F"far too young" to be without their
OL,20,Fmother, and were very frightened, they
OL,21,Fassumed because they were not used to
OL,22,Fhumans.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
