OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAKittens with deformed tails found
OL,4,Aabandoned
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They are gaining strength and
OL,7,Fbeginning to realise that people are
OL,8,Fhere to help them," a spokesperson for
OL,9,Fthe shelter said. "But their story is
OL,10,Falso a reminder of the much bigger
OL,11,Fkitten crisis we are facing."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
